{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115595","id":3224768227,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ANg7j","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115595","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115595.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115595.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115595","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115595/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115595/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115595/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a22c34f7f81861f8488f1cbf058759b1ea11955e","number":115595,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix CSV translation files not reimporting when changed","user":{"login":"snosrati200","id":242628136,"node_id":"U_kgDODnY2KA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242628136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200","html_url":"https://github.com/snosrati200","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #115486.\r\n\r\n## Issue\r\nCSV translation files were not reimported after being modified externally. Changes in translations were only reflected after a manual reimport or an editor restart.\r\n\r\n## Cause\r\nThe CSV translation importer was not assigning an MD5 hash to the metadata. The EditorFileSystem relies on this hash to detect if a source file's content has changed.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nAdded MD5 hash calculation to the importer logic in resource_importer_csv_translation.cpp. This allows the engine to correctly identify modifications and trigger an automatic reimport.\r\n\r\n## How to test\r\n1. Create or import a .csv file with translations.\r\n2. Select one of the generated .translation files and observe its content in the Inspector.\r\n3. Open the .csv file in an external editor.\r\n4. Change a translation value and save the file.\r\n5. Return to Godot. The Inspector should now automatically update to show the new value without any manual intervention.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests 